Drill into scope generation lifecycle history

Usage:
  eshu freshness generations [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string          API key for authentication
      --collector-kind string   Collector kind filter, for example git or terraform_state
      --generation-id string    Exact generation id to drill into a single row
  -h, --help                    help for generations
      --json                    Write the canonical generation lifecycle envelope as JSON
      --limit int               Maximum generation lifecycle rows to return (max 500) (default 50)
      --profile string          Config profile name
      --repository string       Canonical repository id (repository-kind scopes)
      --scope-id string         Exact ingestion scope id to drill into
      --service-url string      API service URL (overrides config)
      --source-system string    Source system filter, for example github
      --status string           Generation status filter (pending|active|superseded|completed|failed)

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
